From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daryl Denson <9751141+denson9874@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 12:23:39 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/6] zuma: pin SystemUIGoogle, the SystemUI this build ships

config_defaultPinnerServiceFiles listed /system_ext/priv-app/SystemUI/SystemUI.apk,
which Evolution X doesn't install (it ships SystemUIGoogle), so PinnerService
pinned nothing for SystemUI and its code could be paged out under memory
pressure. Pin the APK that's there, as LineageOS laguna 03f85c344b does.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 overlay/FrameworkResOverlayVendorZuma/res/values/config.xml | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/overlay/FrameworkResOverlayVendorZuma/res/values/config.xml b/overlay/FrameworkResOverlayVendorZuma/res/values/config.xml
index 2ec67979..ba917cdc 100644
--- a/overlay/FrameworkResOverlayVendorZuma/res/values/config.xml
+++ b/overlay/FrameworkResOverlayVendorZuma/res/values/config.xml
@@ -544,7 +544,7 @@
         <item>/system/framework/framework.jar</item>
         <item>/system/framework/services.jar</item>
         <item>/system/bin/surfaceflinger</item>
-        <item>/system_ext/priv-app/SystemUI/SystemUI.apk</item>
+        <item>/system_ext/priv-app/SystemUIGoogle/SystemUIGoogle.apk</item>
     </string-array>
 
     <!-- Pre-scale volume at volume step 1 for Absolute Volume -->
